&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="中聯辦新版機構設置。（中聯辦網頁截圖）" data-link="" data-src="https://static06.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4150000/4154608/IMG_2229_1200.jpeg" src="https://static06.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4150000/4154608/IMG_2229_1200.jpeg" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
